rule c1xx: the order of a block's locals in the sy list, which is the order C2 reads (and frames) them.
cl
il
  *01 var      #d9 "a" level 2*
  *01 var      #da "b" level 2*
  *01 var      #e0 "h" level 2*
  *01 var      #eb "a" level 2*
  *01 var      #ea "b" level 2*
  *01 var      #e4 "h" level 2*
  *01 var      #f2 "value" level 2*
  *01 var      #f3 "width" level 2*
  *01 var      #ef "count" level 2*
  *01 var      #f0 "total" level 2*
  *01 var      #f1 "index" level 2*
  *01 var      #f4 "height" level 2*
listing
  *_a$ = -4*
  *_h$ = -32*
  *?fwd@@YAHXZ PROC NEAR*
  *_h$ = -32*
  *_a$ = -4*
  *?rev@@YAHXZ PROC NEAR*
  *_count$ = -12*
  *_total$ = -16*
  *_index$ = -20*
  *_value$ = -4*
  *_width$ = -8*
  *_height$ = -24*
